OL,5,G0232 Tech Life
OL,6,     FAI agents carry out tasks
OL,7,     Fautonomously on behalf of users.
OL,8,     FBut what are they capable of, and
OL,9,     Fwhat do we need to know about
OL,10,     Fthem? With AI agents in the news,
OL,11,     Fwe speak to an expert.
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FHow Copa 71, the first women's
OL,17,     FWorld Cup, took on football's 'old
OL,18,     Fmen'. We hear from two Danish
OL,19,     Ffootballers who played in the most
OL,20,     Fwatched women's sporting event in
OL,21,     Fhistory.
